DTSTART:20261129T063000
DTEND:20261129T072500
SUMMARY:[RW] Long run (55 min)
DESCRIPTION:5 min warm-up\; 45 min easy\; 5 min cool-down. Easy means RPE 
 2-3: you can talk in full sentences. Use your watch's easy heart-rate zon
 e if you have one.\n\nWeek 1 (BASE). Not medical advice\; pain that chang
 es how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
