SUMMARY:[RW] Strength: upper body and trunk (pull and push) (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:Triathlon (long distance): better cycling and running economy 
 across a 26-week block. Lift with 2-3 reps in reserve\, stop a set if for
 m breaks. Strength starts at least 3 hours after cardio (practice).\n\nWe
 ek 10 (PEAK). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means s
 top.\nrampwise-plan
