DTSTART:20270203T063000
DTEND:20270203T081000
SUMMARY:[RW] Threshold ride (4 x 6 min) (100 min)
DESCRIPTION:12 min warm-up\; 40 min easy\; 4 x (6 min threshold + 4 min ea
 sy)\; 8 min cool-down. Hard but controlled (RPE 7\, about 95-105 % of FTP
 ).\n\nWeek 11 (PEAK). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how you move
  means stop.\nrampwise-plan
