BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2027-02-21-race-race-day-olympic-tri@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20270221T080000
DTEND:20270221T090000
SUMMARY:[RW] RACE DAY: Olympic triathlon
DESCRIPTION:Run the first kilometre about 5 % slower than your planned pac
 e (Walsh 2019\, one elite study). Start easier than feels necessary for t
 he first third. Eat and drink as practised\, nothing new. It is a day to 
 enjoy the work you did\; no plan can promise a time.\n\nWeek 13 (RACE). N
 ot medical advice\; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-
 plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
